1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,800
W: Welcome back to the office, Greg.

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,480
How was your trip to Milan?

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,560
M: It didn't go quite as well as I had expected.

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:11,440
I had been hoping the client would sign a contract, but he wants to negotiate more.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:14,060
W: It sounds like you'll be returning there soon.

6
00:00:14,715 --> 00:00:18,360
M: Yeah, I'm scheduled to meet Mr. Roberts next Thursday.

7
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,895
But I've got to visit Frankfurt before I go back to Milan.

8
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:22,970
W: Good luck.

9
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,820
If there's anything I can do to help, all you have to do is ask.

10
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,240
M: I'll probably take you up on that offer.

11
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:34,225
I've got two other international customers who need to be visited, but I don't have time.
